      "statement": "default_model_pair() is the deployment-level terminal fallback: it reads LLM_MODEL_ID and LLM_REASONING_EFFORT, validates that the resulting model is supported, default-eligible (not in NON_DEFAULT_MODEL_IDS), and supports its effort, raising ValueError otherwise.",
