      "statement": "For a hosted agent run, build_agent seeds team main/subagent defaults from workspace settings, applies a profile only when no stored thread model exists, then uses stored thread settings when present; a valid cfg.agent_model_id/agent_effort from explicit per-run override replaces that snapshot and is persisted via store_thread_settings.",
